{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_044_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45fe81751ba1547592204ef5aac029e92698000aecae25e79de04318734ab068",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6fc4699fad862ab9b4b88060eb6259749f82b23dbddfcfec2433a4a5732d8d5",
      "text": "这里的污秽是……原来如此。\n是谁从外面带进来的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa7047276efe90ada3dca64746ee3cc1ade44ca5b72c905a8c0f91e150777d6a",
      "text": "（污垢积聚，气场就会浑浊。\n气场浑浊，就会引发纷争……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e53d181dc4823d9ab5b1fc91ec353ee8cc20d88eb203e5b4fd65e9f19eec413c",
      "text": "（可以的话，我可不想在这间事务所里\n看到那种东西）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12df52a56e8ef9d38d6045b54d35ed55d405765050f0081cbd471a3f7559ed0d",
      "text": "（对这个地方，我心怀收留我的恩情。\n得好好报答才行啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4ba814116b31b315deedb52b06409d44fe07bc5779f63b765bab6e345fe34f8",
      "text": "那么……清扫时间到了。\n首先，就来听听你的说法吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000063:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "数分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b04fbc202ea69cad8a777e9211d23fa6b036d6a3ff58bac11fac9f38a8a1189b",
      "text": "雨彦先生，柜子打扫完了。\n哇，走廊变得好干净啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:591c2bd2423fb47c70141ee4e49c23ad6297d1d4c45f102ad2c9f7a439741f0c",
      "text": "能变得这么干净，太厉害了！\n而且……总觉得空气都变得神清气爽了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32021766f6a0f0975d28b79f6196e6c2bd8aff4ac042e32106476fa0f496800d",
      "text": "就算事务所里很干净，到外面工作的话\n总归还是会把脏东西带进来的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:652a5ea55e61a8acb66cbd974b64f7b18d323aa54c0d15d5083114237f8f0e22",
      "text": "确实……下雨天之类的，也会被淋湿弄脏呢。\n我来想想看有什么对策。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_044ame_01_1_2_044_01:1_2_044_01_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8fc2654d7c59b8d0ab0992f46d441954a1b79c2ba983020798bc3bc8b53673",
      "text": "哈哈。嘛，脏了就脏了吧。\n像这样马上打扫干净就好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
